# rubocop keeps `IgnoredMethods = AllowedMethods` for the custom cops that
# include it, sidekiq `JobWrapper = Sidekiq::ActiveJob::Wrapper` for jobs
# already queued under it, Rails `LoadInterlockAwareMonitor =
# DeprecatedConstantProxy.new(...)` for its old callers: public names a
# user writes, read as value constants and never API. A constant that
# names a class or module, or a deprecated proxy for one, is API; a value
# constant still is not (DEC-657).
dead lib Widget::IgnoredMethods=unreferenced~dependents Widget::LoadMonitor=convention-only~dependents Widget::LIMIT=unreferenced~
